{"body": "The department shall publish guidelines and may promulgate regulations necessary for the implementation and administration of this article.\n(1606-W added Dec. 13, 2023, P.L.251, No.34)", "citation_label": "The Fiscal Code \u00a7 1606-W", "citation_path": "us-pa/statute/act-1929-176/article-16w/section-1606-w", "document_class": "statute", "expression_date": "2024-01-03", "heading": "Departmental duties", "id": "b93ded64-8fdb-5a41-8d76-b290151c6c44", "identifiers": {"pennsylvania:act_number": "176", "pennsylvania:act_year": "1929", "pennsylvania:article": "16W", "pennsylvania:section": "1606-W", "pennsylvania:source_id": "1929-176-1606-W"}, "jurisdiction": "us-pa", "kind": "section", "language": "en", "legal_identifier": "The Fiscal Code \u00a7 1606-W", "level": 2, "metadata": {"act_number": "176", "act_year": "1929", "article": "16W", "display_number": "1606-W", "kind": "section", "parent_citation_path": "us-pa/statute/act-1929-176/article-16w", "source_history": ["(1606-W added Dec. 13, 2023, P.L.251, No.34)"]}, "ordinal": 7, "parent_citation_path": "us-pa/statute/act-1929-176/article-16w", "parent_id": "00e7ba89-cea0-58e7-848b-416e03e5a9cc", "source_as_of": "2024-01-03", "source_format": "pennsylvania-unconsolidated-statutes-html", "source_id": "1929-176-1606-W", "source_path": "sources/us-pa/statute/2026-07-26-pa-refundable-tax-credit-statutes-us-pa-act-1929-176-articles-16w-16w.2/pennsylvania-unconsolidated-statutes-html/act-1929-176/article-16w.html", "source_url": "https://www.palegis.us/statutes/unconsolidated/law-information/view-statute?100&iFrame=true&txtType=HTM&SessYr=1929&SessInd=0&ActNum=0176.&chpt=16W&subchpt=000.", "version": "2026-07-26-pa-refundable-tax-credit-statutes-us-pa-act-1929-176-articles-16w-16w.2"}
{"body": "(a) Annual report.--No later than March 1, 2024, and each March 1 thereafter, the department shall submit a report to the General Assembly indicating the effectiveness of the tax credit under this article.\n(b) Information required.--The report required under subsection (a) shall include, but not be limited to, the following information:\n(1) The number of tax credits approved under this article.\n(2) The amount of tax credits approved under this article.\n(3) The amount of tax credits claimed under this article.\n(4) The amount of tax credits refunded under this article.\n(1607-W added Dec. 13, 2023, P.L.251, No.34)", "citation_label": "The Fiscal Code \u00a7 1607-W", "citation_path": "us-pa/statute/act-1929-176/article-16w/section-1607-w", "document_class": "statute", "expression_date": "2024-01-03", "heading": "Report to General Assembly", "id": "21c0a43c-65ae-52a2-991c-8369846a94d4", "identifiers": {"pennsylvania:act_number": "176", "pennsylvania:act_year": "1929", "pennsylvania:article": "16W", "pennsylvania:section": "1607-W", "pennsylvania:source_id": "1929-176-1607-W"}, "jurisdiction": "us-pa", "kind": "section", "language": "en", "legal_identifier": "The Fiscal Code \u00a7 1607-W", "level": 2, "metadata": {"act_number": "176", "act_year": "1929", "article": "16W", "display_number": "1607-W", "kind": "section", "parent_citation_path": "us-pa/statute/act-1929-176/article-16w", "source_history": ["(1607-W added Dec. 13, 2023, P.L.251, No.34)"]}, "ordinal": 8, "parent_citation_path": "us-pa/statute/act-1929-176/article-16w", "parent_id": "00e7ba89-cea0-58e7-848b-416e03e5a9cc", "source_as_of": "2024-01-03", "source_format": "pennsylvania-unconsolidated-statutes-html", "source_id": "1929-176-1607-W", "source_path": "sources/us-pa/statute/2026-07-26-pa-refundable-tax-credit-statutes-us-pa-act-1929-176-articles-16w-16w.2/pennsylvania-unconsolidated-statutes-html/act-1929-176/article-16w.html", "source_url": "https://www.palegis.us/statutes/unconsolidated/law-information/view-statute?100&iFrame=true&txtType=HTM&SessYr=1929&SessInd=0&ActNum=0176.&chpt=16W&subchpt=000.", "version": "2026-07-26-pa-refundable-tax-credit-statutes-us-pa-act-1929-176-articles-16w-16w.2"}
